  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这个资源包改变了许多Minecraft原版动物外观！目前，它具体更改了以下动物的外观（尽管还有更多纹理即将到来）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 牛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 羊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 猪</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 鸡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豹猫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 狼</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 猫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 熊猫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 蘑菇牛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 骆驼</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 干骆驼</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 海龟</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 马</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>（也适用于OptiFine）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">牛、羊、猪、鸡、熊猫和蘑菇牛的纹理和模型设计师是 AviArt。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">豹猫、狼和猫的纹理和模型设计师是 Matt_Hopes。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要与朋友一起游玩服务器吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找一个可以玩任何模组或模组包的服务器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span>是您的解决方案！他们拥有最高性价比的Minecraft服务器，如果您点击<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个链接</a></strong></span>，您将获得25%的折扣，使用代码\"Lupin\"。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">这个资源包改变了社区中最受欢迎的一些原版动物外观，当然，它们现在看起来会更逼真有趣！但不用担心，它们仍然以兼容原版的方式运行，同时与默认纹理有些相似。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在服务器上有效吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！它运行完美！记住，与朋友一起玩模组的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting，并且通过<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接可获得25%折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个资源包可以用于模组包吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然！只要它只在Modrinth或CurseForge上发布。上传到任何其他平台都将侵犯我们的权利，这是不允许的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">然而，如果您考虑将其添加到您的Modrinth或CurseForge模组包中，我们将非常感激。如果您需要任何更改或有任何疑问，请与我们联系！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/599/realistic-pig.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/600/realistic-cows-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/601/realistic-wolves-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/603/realistic-cats-7.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/604/realistic-ocelots-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
